# Delete ad hoc scripts

A script written only to do a one-off job (one-time copy, one-time restore, one-time check) is not part of the product.

After that job is done (or abandoned):

1. Delete the script and any test that exists only for it.
2. Do not keep it "in case we need it."
3. Scripts that are meant to be reused stay.
